 feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nShipment Status Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nWaybill AWB-8839-291X Shipment approaching destination Processed Oct 12 Dispatched Oct 14 Local Hub Oct 15 Delivered Pending Estimated Arrival OCT 16 by 10:00 PM local time View Route Details SMS Updates Real-time statu…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Shipment approaching destination; Estimated Arrival.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #000000, accent #6366F1, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Shipment Status</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 lg:p-12 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-200\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Outer Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-600/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-zinc-800/80 shadow-[0_40px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Inner Main Container -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full bg-zinc-950 rounded-[calc(1.5rem-1px)] flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Top Section: Header & Timeline -->\n            <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-12 pb-12 lg:pb-16 flex flex-col\">\n\n                <!-- Tracking Ref -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-300 shadow-sm shadow-black/50\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 uppercase\">Waybill</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-zinc-200\">AWB-8839-291X</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Masked Reveal Title -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight text-white font-medium leading-[1.1]\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"inline-block word translate-y-[110%]\">Shipment</span></span><br>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"inline-block word translate-y-[110%] text-indigo-400\">approaching</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"inline-block word translate-y-[110%]\">destination</span></span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Horizontal/Vertical Timeline -->\n                <div class=\"relative mt-16 lg:mt-24 w-full px-2 lg:px-4\">\n                    <!-- Desktop Connecting Line -->\n                    <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-5 left-8 right-8 h-[2px] bg-zinc-800/80 -z-10 rounded-full\">\n                        <!-- Progress Fill -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[66%] bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-900 to-indigo-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Mobile Connecting Line -->\n                    <div class=\"block lg:hidden absolute top-8 bottom-8 left-[1.6rem] w-[2px] bg-zinc-800/80 -z-10 rounded-full\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[66%] bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-900 to-indigo-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between gap-10 lg:gap-4\">\n                        <!-- Node 1: Processed -->\n                        <div class=\"flex lg:flex-col items-center gap-5 lg:gap-4 relative z-10 lg:w-32 lg:-ml-12\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border-2 border-indigo-500/40 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start lg:items-center text-left lg:text-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-zinc-300 uppercase\">Processed</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Oct 12</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Node 2: Dispatched -->\n                        <div class=\"flex lg:flex-col items-center gap-5 lg:gap-4 relative z-10 lg:w-32 lg:-ml-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border-2 border-indigo-500/40 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start lg:items-center text-left lg:text-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-zinc-300 uppercase\">Dispatched</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Oct 14</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Node 3: Local Hub (Current) -->\n                        <div class=\"flex lg:flex-col items-center gap-5 lg:gap-4 relative z-10 lg:w-32 lg:ml-6\">\n                            <div class=\"relative w-10 h-10 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-full animate-ping\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full bg-indigo-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)] relative z-10\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-2-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start lg:items-center text-left lg:text-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-indigo-400 uppercase\">Local Hub</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Oct 15</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Node 4: Delivered -->\n                        <div class=\"flex lg:flex-col items-center gap-5 lg:gap-4 relative z-10 lg:w-32 lg:-mr-12 opacity-50 grayscale\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-950 border-2 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-600 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-angle-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start lg:items-center text-left lg:text-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-zinc-500 uppercase\">Delivered</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Pending</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Section: Split Grid Layout -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-[1px] bg-zinc-800/50\">\n\n                <!-- Left Detail Panel -->\n                <div class=\"bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between backdrop-blur-sm min-h-[320px]\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500 uppercase mb-4 lg:mb-6\">Estimated Arrival</h3>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white leading-none\">OCT 16</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 font-medium tracking-wide mt-2\">by 10:00 PM local time</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-12 flex items-center gap-6\">\n                        <button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-900 hover:bg-white transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-400 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-zinc-900\" aria-label=\"Track live on map\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-zinc-300 uppercase cursor-pointer hover:text-white transition-colors\">View Route Details</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Action & Map Panel -->\n                <div class=\"bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 lg:p-12 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between backdrop-blur-sm min-h-[320px]\">\n\n                    <!-- Dotted Background Abstraction -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 24px 24px;\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Custom SMS Toggle -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-800/40 border border-zinc-700/50\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-zinc-700/50 flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-600/30\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-bing-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100\">SMS Updates</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5\">Real-time status alerts</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button class=\"w-12 h-7 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full p-1 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-end transition-all focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-zinc-900 shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Toggle SMS alerts\">\n                            <div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white rounded-full shadow-sm\"></div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Mini Map Route Abstraction -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-12 mb-4 h-24 flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6\">\n\n                        <svg class=\"absolute w-full h-16 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 left-0 right-0 pointer-events-none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                            <path d=\"M 10 50 Q 50 10 90 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"text-indigo-500/20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>\n                        </svg>\n\n                        <!-- Origin Node -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[10%] -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-600 border-2 border-zinc-900 relative z-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest\">LHR</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Current Location Node -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[50%] -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"relative w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center z-10\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-500/40 rounded-full animate-ping\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(99,102,241,1)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-0.5\">JFK</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Destination Node -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[90%] -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 border-2 border-zinc-700 relative z-10\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 uppercase tracking-widest\">SFO</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Initialize GSAP ScrollTrigger\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Staggered word reveal animation\n        gsap.to(\".word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 1.2,\n            stagger: 0.12,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: \"h1\",\n                start: \"top 90%\",\n                toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "shipment-status.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/shipment-status.jpg", "source_name": "shipment-status-DESIGN.md", "views": 21, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T19:07:31.067364+00:00"}